  "title": "Old-Fashioned Persimmon Cookies",
  "description": "These persimmon cookies come from an old family recipe made from cloves, walnuts, nutmeg, cinnamon, and the Hachiya variety of persimmon pulp.",
  "authors": [
    "Ruth"
  ],
